WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.155
From a dark place.

00:01.924 --> 00:09.315
Far from any town, on a night with no Moon, there are more stars than you can count, and they lie thickest along one band of the sky.

00:09.844 --> 00:14.219
That band is the Milky Way: our own galaxy, seen from inside.

00:14.816 --> 00:18.399
One person in three alive today cannot see it from where they live.
